del_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "9fbc5145-eadf-426c-8669-fabdb68a99dc", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790402011.5220466, "updated_at": 1790402033.483013, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Yeah, yeah, there you go. Now I can't, I flip-flopped that. The objective is Don can operate. The intent is figure out what the fuck's broken. The hypothesis is this may be it. That's what we got to get in the habit of in our, in our framework", "text_chars": 244, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "7c5a5e4f-9426-4aa8-a91b-b4e38c376b11", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790402013.142231, "updated_at": 1790402015.236378, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Those are hypotheses, not the objective. The objective is Don can operate. Everything else", "text_chars": 91, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "f71d9ddc-f25e-4db2-8831-c4db4ead92a3", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790402029.4066572, "updated_at": 1790402064.933905, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Well, hold on a second. I'm saying this- I'm saying this overall. Don's intent is to do Edge Crew Quant analytically. The objective, build the math engine. The intent to lock in picks with Edge expected value and arbitrage Mathematically. You see what I'm saying in the framework? Everything needs to have that, that is like star important because it'll prevent loops and the orchestrator could chime in and say, we didn't deliver the objective. That's all I got to say to you guys", "text_chars": 482, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "6c15e270-456b-48a1-a4d0-c8a4319102df", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790402031.546354, "updated_at": 1790402033.483229, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Locked in. Objective: Don operates. Intent: resolve the blockage fast.", "text_chars": 71, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "ab81310b-04d7-43cd-b934-88338ff11200", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790402060.8347776, "updated_at": 1790402098.521779, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Hypo-yeah, hypothesis one, checkbox. We-okay, you guys are right, right? Shit like that. It's not complicated to me", "text_chars": 116, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "147d149b-2109-4005-bf1b-bf9fcda839d6", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790402062.470851, "updated_at": 1790402064.93412, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Crystal.", "text_chars": 9, "code_blocks